<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολύβδ-αινα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>piece of lead</i>, used as
				<i>the sink</i> of a fishing-line, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.80
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bullet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. χερμαδία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>plumb</i> in a mason's line, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.147
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a metallic
			substance, prob. <i>sulphuret of lead, galena</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.188
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				735b16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				34.173
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a plant,
				<i>Plumbago europaea</i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				25.155
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
